eId":"n415"},{"text":"[^n416]: Perhaps a comma should be inserted after sign.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n416"},{"text":"[^n417]: Luke iv. 14b.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n417"},{"text":"[^n418]: Luke iv. 15.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n418"},{"text":"[^n419]: If the text does not contain a misprint the word for by is wanting in both mss. It should doubtless be restored as in § 7, 3.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n419"},{"text":"[^n420]: Luke iv. 16.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n420"},{"text":"[^n421]: Luke iv. 17.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n421"},{"text":"[^n422]: Luke iv. 18.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n422"}],"chars":13803,"notes":{}}
